WEBVTT


00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:44.072
Subtitles: Kronzky


00:00:49.247 --> 00:00:54.162
-


00:00:54.247 --> 00:00:55.965
-


00:00:56.047 --> 00:00:59.562
-


00:00:59.647 --> 00:01:02.241
-


00:01:02.327 --> 00:01:05.683
-


00:01:05.887 --> 00:01:11.166
-


00:01:11.247 --> 00:01:15.957
-


00:01:16.607 --> 00:01:20.805
Gisela, I have to leave
- What are you doing?


00:01:33.647 --> 00:01:35.877
Gisela!
- Oh, I see.


00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:38.086
Come on, let's go.


00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:47.406
Ok, meet you at the English Park tomorrow at noon.
In front the lake cabin?


00:01:47.487 --> 00:01:51.605
Yes, Hans really should give me a call.
- I'll remind him.


00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:55.919
- Has he calmed down again?
- You shouldn't have yelled at him like that.


00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.562
But it'll be ok.


00:02:36.007 --> 00:02:40.956
Finally, it was about time.
Hurry, let's go.


00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:48.364
Is this all?
That's it. The rest hasn't arrived yet...


00:03:02.047 --> 00:03:05.756
"Germans are shocked by soliders who
fell into the abyss of death at Stalingrad


00:03:05.847 --> 00:03:10.045
330,000 fellowmen are forced to
death and extermination step by step


00:03:10.127 --> 00:03:13.244
by the great genius of our strategists,
meaninglessly and irresponsibly."


00:03:13.327 --> 00:03:17.240
Little Sophie, I'm sure Willi would appreciate it
if you could help him.


00:03:42.527 --> 00:03:46.566
Here are the stamps.
And the address list.


00:03:47.767 --> 00:03:49.041
Thanks.


00:03:59.047 --> 00:04:00.844
What happens with the rest?


00:04:11.567 --> 00:04:13.876
I'll go deliver them at
the university tomorrow.


00:04:19.247 --> 00:04:22.478
Are you crazy? - Willi, at the students uprising
at the German Museum recently,


00:04:22.567 --> 00:04:26.355
it nearly happened.
- Gestapo has been on ground alert ever since.


00:04:26.447 --> 00:04:29.166
Hans... And our slogans are everywhere!


00:04:29.247 --> 00:04:31.841
Hans, we'll hide the rest under the boards
until we get new envelopes.


00:04:31.927 --> 00:04:34.395
No need. There is nothing left.
Lack of paper.


00:04:34.487 --> 00:04:37.923
It's already pretty dangerous
to write slogans on walls at night...


00:04:38.487 --> 00:04:42.036
But handing out flyers at campus
in the middle of the day... Are you crazy?


00:04:42.127 --> 00:04:45.244
We have to do somethign now!
We'lll get this city moving!


00:04:45.327 --> 00:04:48.160
Especially now, after Stalingrad,
the whole campus is full of snitches!


00:04:48.247 --> 00:04:49.885
If the Bolshevists come now,
they'll get all those wimps...


00:04:49.967 --> 00:04:52.162
...all at once.
- If I were you if wouldn't be sure


00:04:52.247 --> 00:04:54.556
if having the Soviets come before
the Americans is such a good thing.


00:04:54.847 --> 00:05:00.080
Don't you hate the Bolshevist the most?
Hans, it is madness!


00:05:00.487 --> 00:05:02.205
Don't do it!


00:05:02.647 --> 00:05:04.956
I'll go when they are having classes,
nobody will be in the hall...


00:05:05.047 --> 00:05:07.766
I'll be out right away.
In from the front, out the back.


00:05:07.847 --> 00:05:10.361
- It's too dangerous!
- Willi...


00:05:11.047 --> 00:05:13.163
I will take full responsiblity.


00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:15.966
It'll be just me.


00:05:18.447 --> 00:05:21.041
You are going to walk through Schwabing
with a big suitcase?


00:05:22.127 --> 00:05:23.526
I'll take that.


00:05:25.567 --> 00:05:27.478
Hans, I don't think we should
have Sophie...


00:05:27.567 --> 00:05:30.240
If we are checked,
it'll be easier with a woman.


00:05:32.887 --> 00:05:34.479
She is right.


00:05:36.927 --> 00:05:39.760
Alright, let's go then.


00:05:52.647 --> 00:05:54.444
Alex, meet me in my place
at twelve tomorrow.


00:05:59.367 --> 00:06:02.803
So tomorrow? Right away?
- The Nazis won't wait.


00:06:37.807 --> 00:06:39.001
Thanks.


00:06:41.927 --> 00:06:43.599
Don't work too late.


00:06:43.687 --> 00:06:45.723
- Good night.
- Good night.


00:07:16.287 --> 00:07:20.724
<i>Dear Lisa,</i>
<i>I'm listening to Schubert's Trout Quintet.</i>


00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:24.925
<i>I feel Schubert's inspriation</i>
<i>is flowing in the air.</i>


00:07:25.207 --> 00:07:29.564
<i>I can hear the jubilations of the birds</i>
<i>and the whole creation.</i>


00:07:30.047 --> 00:07:34.359
<i>The piano repeats the same theme,</i>
<i>like a clear crystal creek</i>


00:07:35.607 --> 00:07:40.123
<i>Oh, they make me feel enchanted.</i>
<i>Wish I could hear from you soon.</i>


00:07:41.007 --> 00:07:43.475
<i>Best wishes</i>
<i>Yours, Sophie</i>


00:08:04.287 --> 00:08:08.565
You think mom might still have some jam?
You only get turnip sirup with food stamps now.


00:08:16.927 --> 00:08:18.599
Inconspicuous enough?


00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:30.719
Today there's be sparks flying
at the campus. - Yes


00:09:53.207 --> 00:09:54.401
Morning!


00:09:55.167 --> 00:09:58.842
Morning. - We're going to the neurology clinic.
You want to come along?


00:09:59.367 --> 00:10:02.643
Sophie is going to Ulm. I will be there soon, too.
- Come now.


00:12:00.407 --> 00:12:04.878
Get out, hurry!
Come on, hurry up!


00:12:10.847 --> 00:12:13.361
There are still some in the case, Hans.
- What?


00:12:19.487 --> 00:12:22.320
No one's upstairs, wait a second.
- I'm coming along.


00:13:16.367 --> 00:13:18.358
Freeze!
Stop!


00:13:20.247 --> 00:13:24.638
Stop right now!
You there...Stop right now!


00:13:24.767 --> 00:13:28.840
You are under arrest! Stop, damnit!
- What's wrong?


00:13:28.967 --> 00:13:32.243
You are under arrest!
That's ridiculous, you can't just arrest us!


00:13:32.367 --> 00:13:35.643
You were the only people upstairs. Come here!
- We were at the Psychology Department.


00:13:35.727 --> 00:13:38.002
- You were handing out flyers!
- Nonsense!


00:13:38.087 --> 00:13:42.000
Let him go!
I threw down those flyers.


00:13:42.087 --> 00:13:46.877
I'm going to report you.
You come with me, both of you!


00:13:48.127 --> 00:13:52.325
Believe me, even in my college you cannot
get away with stuff like that.


00:13:53.327 --> 00:13:55.238
"Stunned - stand the German peoples
before their downfall..."


00:13:55.327 --> 00:13:57.636
Come in!


00:14:04.447 --> 00:14:06.802
That many? Unbelievable!


00:14:06.887 --> 00:14:08.400
Are those all?
- Yes!


00:14:08.647 --> 00:14:09.796
You can go now!


00:14:10.007 --> 00:14:12.316
Schmid, issue a report.


00:14:13.447 --> 00:14:15.881
We will catch them all.


00:14:16.847 --> 00:14:20.283
There...there
This student got something...


00:14:21.847 --> 00:14:25.237
Give it to me!
Look, another flyer.


00:14:25.327 --> 00:14:28.285
Give it to me!
Or you want me to use force?


00:14:38.367 --> 00:14:41.439
That's all part of it.


00:14:49.887 --> 00:14:53.243
Mohr, national police. Heil Hitler.
- Heil Hitler.


00:14:53.367 --> 00:14:55.562
These two are under temporary arrest...


00:14:55.647 --> 00:14:59.196
And this is the pamphlet.
- I got those two...


00:15:09.767 --> 00:15:11.883
Do you have any ID?


00:15:34.927 --> 00:15:38.283
Ms. Sophia Magdalena Scholl?
- Yes.


00:15:40.607 --> 00:15:43.724
Mr. Hans Fritz Scholl?
- Yes.


00:15:44.087 --> 00:15:46.362
Brother and sister?
- Yes.


00:15:48.087 --> 00:15:50.476
The weaker sex.


00:15:52.847 --> 00:15:54.644
21 years old...


00:15:57.887 --> 00:16:00.162
Is that supposed to be the resistance
against the German Reich that...


00:16:00.287 --> 00:16:02.084
is controlling all of Europe?


00:16:02.167 --> 00:16:05.443
The young man tried to destroy these papers
in my presence.


00:16:05.527 --> 00:16:08.087
Some unknown classmate
gave them to me.


00:16:08.167 --> 00:16:10.761
I destroyed them because I didn't want
to get into trouble.


00:16:14.047 --> 00:16:16.959
Is this your suitcase?
- Yes, it's mine.


00:16:18.687 --> 00:16:20.040
Take him away!


00:16:25.647 --> 00:16:29.720
I've given the order to
close off the college for now.


00:16:30.007 --> 00:16:33.124
Not even teachers or other personnal
are allowed to leave.


00:16:33.207 --> 00:16:35.846
Sure!
I will certainly stay too.


00:16:48.487 --> 00:16:51.160
Go back, and tell Alex not to wait for me.
- Quiet!


00:18:10.327 --> 00:18:13.399
Scholl, Hans, get into Mahler's room
for interrogation!


00:18:16.087 --> 00:18:17.884
Hurry up, miss!


00:18:19.327 --> 00:18:20.840
Come here now!


00:18:22.807 --> 00:18:24.399
Unlock the cuffs!


00:18:26.047 --> 00:18:27.241
Thanks.


00:19:15.687 --> 00:19:17.120
Let's get going.


00:19:32.567 --> 00:19:34.046
Sit down.


00:19:41.047 --> 00:19:44.960
Sophia Magdalena Scholl, from Ulm,


00:19:45.647 --> 00:19:49.003
born on May 9, 1921
in Forchtenberg.


00:19:49.087 --> 00:19:52.238
Protestant.
- Father?


00:19:52.807 --> 00:19:55.844
Robert Scholl,
mayor of Forchtenberg.


00:19:55.967 --> 00:20:00.358
You completed your nursing education?
- Yes.


00:20:01.007 --> 00:20:04.886
Still with a second address in Munich,
Franz-Joseph St. #13,


00:20:04.967 --> 00:20:07.561
- Summerhouse, landlord Schmidt?
- Yes.


00:20:07.647 --> 00:20:10.366
Any criminal record?
- No.


00:20:11.967 --> 00:20:14.435
You admitted to the janitor
that it was you...


00:20:14.527 --> 00:20:17.917
who threw the flyers from the balcony.


00:20:18.007 --> 00:20:20.077
They were lying on the marble handrail.


00:20:20.487 --> 00:20:23.001
I pushed them over
when I passed by.


00:20:24.407 --> 00:20:25.681
Why?


00:20:25.767 --> 00:20:28.076
Such pranks are my nature.


00:20:28.287 --> 00:20:31.404
I admitted it then and there
and I knew ...


00:20:31.487 --> 00:20:34.843
I made a stupid mistake
when I pushed them over.


00:20:36.367 --> 00:20:39.245
I am very sorry now,
but I guess it's too late.


00:20:40.327 --> 00:20:45.447
Miss Scholl,
you spread flyers in college,


00:20:45.527 --> 00:20:48.280
in violation of the
special war laws.


00:20:48.367 --> 00:20:52.201
Do you know what the punishment for
treason and collaboration is?


00:20:54.847 --> 00:20:59.637
I don't have anything to do with that.
- Imprisonment, labour camp...


00:21:00.047 --> 00:21:03.676
or execution.
- I really didn't have anything to do with that.


00:21:21.727 --> 00:21:25.197
Cigarettes?
- No, thanks.


00:21:26.447 --> 00:21:30.201
But you do smoke, right?
- Occasionally.


00:22:01.247 --> 00:22:03.158
They're a perfect fit.


00:22:04.567 --> 00:22:05.966
Just coincidence.


00:22:14.007 --> 00:22:17.158
Why did you bring an empty case to school?


00:22:17.727 --> 00:22:20.002
I wanted to go to Ulm,
to pick up the clothes


00:22:20.087 --> 00:22:23.796
that I brought to my mother last week.
- To Ulm?


00:22:23.887 --> 00:22:27.197
That far?
In the middle of the week?


00:22:27.647 --> 00:22:29.842
Yes
- Just for some clothes?


00:22:31.967 --> 00:22:35.482
No, not just. I also want to visit a friend.
She just had a baby.


00:22:36.407 --> 00:22:39.638
Also, my mother is sick.
- But why in the middle of the week?


00:22:39.727 --> 00:22:42.924
But you are having classes!
You seem to be in quite a hurry.


00:22:43.287 --> 00:22:46.040
Because my friend suggested
going to Hamburg,


00:22:46.127 --> 00:22:47.924
so I want to get back
before the weekend.


00:22:48.927 --> 00:22:52.044
I planed to take
the 12:48 express train.


00:22:54.367 --> 00:22:56.835
I already made an appointment with
my sister's friend at the Holzkirchner station.


00:22:56.927 --> 00:22:58.645
You can ask him.


00:23:01.567 --> 00:23:03.956
His name?
- Otto Aicher.


00:23:05.567 --> 00:23:11.119
He arrived from Solln at 11:30...
11:30 in Munich.


00:23:11.207 --> 00:23:13.880
Aicher, with an "e"?
- With "a - i"


00:23:16.727 --> 00:23:19.116
Didn't you have dirty clothes
for Ulm?


00:23:19.767 --> 00:23:22.440
No, I wash my own small clothes.


00:23:22.567 --> 00:23:25.035
And large pieces
I didn't have any yet.


00:23:30.767 --> 00:23:34.237
So, it means you don't need
any clean clothes yet?


00:23:35.007 --> 00:23:36.963
and you just told me


00:23:37.047 --> 00:23:40.119
that you expressly took an empty suitcase home
to get clean clothes?


00:23:40.207 --> 00:23:43.517
I wanted to be prepared for the next weeks,
since I was in Ulm anyway.


00:23:45.607 --> 00:23:49.202
So, if you wanted to go back to Ulm,
why were you still at school?


00:23:49.447 --> 00:23:52.962
I had an appointment with a friend.
Her name is Gisela Schertling


00:23:53.047 --> 00:23:56.517
We planned to have lunch together
in the cabin at English Garden at noon.


00:23:56.607 --> 00:23:58.723
Even though you wanted
to go to Ulm?


00:24:00.807 --> 00:24:03.082
I changed my mind last night...


00:24:03.167 --> 00:24:06.159
I came back to school
to cancel my appointment with Gisela.


00:24:36.527 --> 00:24:39.917
Why did your brother accompany you
to school?


00:24:40.367 --> 00:24:42.961
since you only came to
cancel the appointment?


00:24:43.127 --> 00:24:47.166
Hans and I often go to school together.
He wanted to go to the neurological clinic.


00:24:50.207 --> 00:24:54.086
The janitor said you were on the 2nd floor balcony
at about 11 o'clock.


00:24:54.927 --> 00:24:58.556
What were you doing there?
- We were on the way to Gisela.


00:24:58.647 --> 00:25:02.526
She was in Prof. Huber's
introductory philosophy class.


00:25:02.847 --> 00:25:06.556
But that's on the 1st floor.
- Yes, we were there 10 minutes early,


00:25:06.647 --> 00:25:09.445
so I showed my brother around
at the psychology department.


00:25:09.567 --> 00:25:13.242
I often have classes on the 2nd floor.


00:25:13.327 --> 00:25:15.443
And where did you see the flyers?


00:25:15.727 --> 00:25:18.480
I saw them everywhere on the ground,
if that's what you mean.


00:25:18.567 --> 00:25:21.843
And you didn't even read them?
- Yes, I did, but only at a glance.


00:25:23.607 --> 00:25:26.758
My brother was even joking about them.
- A political joke?


00:25:26.847 --> 00:25:32.160
No, just that it's a waste of paper.
He's as unpolitical as me.


00:25:40.367 --> 00:25:43.837
During the uprising of the female students
at the Germany Museum,


00:25:43.927 --> 00:25:45.838
when the district principal was
holding a speech,


00:25:46.847 --> 00:25:48.360
were you there?


00:25:48.887 --> 00:25:50.161
No.


00:25:50.487 --> 00:25:55.003
Attendance was mandatory.
- I stay out of politics.


00:25:55.247 --> 00:25:57.636
What do you think of the speech,
given by district principal


00:25:57.767 --> 00:26:00.042
when he mentioned...


00:26:00.367 --> 00:26:02.756
that girls should rather have
give birth to babies, for the Führer,


00:26:02.847 --> 00:26:06.362
instead of fooling around at college.


00:26:06.487 --> 00:26:10.196
He even said that the ugly ones
could marry to his assistents.


00:26:11.367 --> 00:26:13.005
That's a matter of taste.


00:26:16.607 --> 00:26:19.440
The circumstances under which
you were found at the university


00:26:19.527 --> 00:26:22.758
already make you a suspect.
I seriously advise you


00:26:22.847 --> 00:26:26.476
to tell me the full truth right now,
independent of any side effects this might have.


00:26:27.767 --> 00:26:31.043
I deny to have any connection
with these leaflets.


00:26:31.167 --> 00:26:35.445
Except the joke I made.
I understand that


00:26:35.567 --> 00:26:38.206
we are under suspicion
until the real culprits are found.


00:26:38.287 --> 00:26:43.042
- But my brother and I really
have nothing to do with this.


00:26:43.167 --> 00:26:46.603
Do you really think you can hide
your true feelings from me?


00:26:47.847 --> 00:26:50.042
All I told you is the truth.


00:27:29.367 --> 00:27:32.006
Mrs Scholl, my colleagues did not find
any traces of the flyers...


00:27:32.127 --> 00:27:36.086
in your suitcase. And your brother confirmed
your statements during his interrogations.


00:27:40.567 --> 00:27:41.795
Reliefed?


00:27:42.967 --> 00:27:45.037
I wasn't worried.


00:27:49.967 --> 00:27:51.958
Have the transcriber come in.


00:27:55.167 --> 00:27:58.284
I will let her to record my statement.
You have to listen carefully...


00:27:58.407 --> 00:28:02.161
If there is any conflict with your statement
you must tell me right away.


00:28:02.447 --> 00:28:05.484
Do you understand, Mrs Scholl?
- Yes.


00:28:05.607 --> 00:28:08.485
Even though you will be placed
under temporary arrest,


00:28:08.607 --> 00:28:10.996
but...
it depends...


00:28:11.567 --> 00:28:15.685
Maybe you still can go to Ulm tonight.


00:28:19.687 --> 00:28:20.517
You're done?


00:28:31.047 --> 00:28:33.607
Metternich! Release papers.
Heil Hitler. - Heil Hitler.


00:28:33.727 --> 00:28:35.240
Mr. Schürmer! Come along!


00:28:42.207 --> 00:28:45.165
You students think you can be here,
and keep us busy


00:28:45.247 --> 00:28:46.566
with your phantasies.


00:28:46.727 --> 00:28:50.766
Please hand over your jewellery.
Your watch.


00:28:50.847 --> 00:28:53.645
<i>(Radio) ...we already made up our mind to</i>
<i>defend our lives by any means.</i>


00:28:53.767 --> 00:28:58.636
<i>...no matter whether the</i>
<i>rest of the world</i>


00:28:58.767 --> 00:29:01.440
<i>understand the necessity of this war or not</i>
- Necklace with pendant.


00:29:02.367 --> 00:29:06.997
<i>...The time for a total war has come...</i>


00:29:07.127 --> 00:29:10.597
Follow me.


00:29:12.407 --> 00:29:16.446
<i>Let us say farewell to fear</i>
<i>and bourgouis squeamishness,</i>


00:29:16.527 --> 00:29:18.563
<i>who, in this fight with fate...</i>


00:29:18.647 --> 00:29:21.445
<i>still live by the rule</i>
<i>Clean my back,</i>


00:29:21.527 --> 00:29:24.917
<i>but don't get me wet!</i>
- Please take off you clothes and give them to me.


00:29:32.967 --> 00:29:34.844
<i>There is enormous danger.</i>


00:29:34.967 --> 00:29:37.959
<i>We must put into huge effort...</i>


00:29:38.047 --> 00:29:41.596
If you still have anything illegal, give it to me,
and I'll throw it down the toilet.


00:29:42.007 --> 00:29:45.204
I am a prisoner too.
<i>Now, that time is coming...</i>


00:29:45.327 --> 00:29:46.999
I have nothing.


00:29:47.407 --> 00:29:50.399
<i>...it's time to take off the gloves!</i>


00:30:04.847 --> 00:30:07.441
OK, we're here.


00:30:07.527 --> 00:30:10.758
<i>... will thank us on his knees</i>
<i>that we have taken him on</i>


00:30:11.687 --> 00:30:14.759
Ladies, get in, hurry, hurry.
I want to listen to the speech!


00:30:37.167 --> 00:30:39.203
Have you heard anything
about my brother?


00:30:39.327 --> 00:30:42.205
Your brother is already done.
He is waiting with other men upstairs.


00:30:42.327 --> 00:30:45.000
You are the main suspect right now
since you had the large suitcase...


00:30:45.127 --> 00:30:49.359
and you threw down the leaflets.
Do not admit anything!


00:30:49.687 --> 00:30:51.678
There's nothing to admit.


00:31:00.047 --> 00:31:03.722
How long have you been here?
- One year and five days.


00:31:04.047 --> 00:31:08.040
They caught one of my letters,
with Ludwig-Thoma quotes critical of Hitler


00:31:08.967 --> 00:31:12.516
Even though, you still work for those people?
- They make me to do this.


00:31:15.647 --> 00:31:18.081
The reason I am here
is to prevent you to kill yourself...


00:31:27.967 --> 00:31:31.198
Why are you against the Nazis?
- My brother and I are Communists,


00:31:31.287 --> 00:31:33.437
even though my brother has a
senior position in an insurance company.


00:31:33.567 --> 00:31:36.161
But I admire the selfless help
among the Communists.


00:31:36.247 --> 00:31:37.965
People have to do something.


00:31:50.927 --> 00:31:52.997
Scholl, Sophia.
Come with me!


00:31:54.807 --> 00:31:59.517
I hope, we'll never see each other.
Good luck! - You too, good luck!


00:32:08.167 --> 00:32:09.566
Wait here.


00:32:15.567 --> 00:32:20.038
OK, Miss, here are your release papers.
You were lucky this time.


00:32:46.927 --> 00:32:48.201
Admissions.


00:32:52.527 --> 00:32:53.721
Understood!


00:32:55.207 --> 00:32:57.277
Follow me. Follow me!


00:33:05.687 --> 00:33:07.678
You can take off your coat.


00:33:20.287 --> 00:33:21.800
Sit down.


00:33:35.047 --> 00:33:38.278
Your father was put into jail for 6 weeks
because he called our leader...


00:33:38.407 --> 00:33:40.875
"God's punishment for humans".


00:33:41.887 --> 00:33:44.355
He was arrested for the
crime of treason,


00:33:44.687 --> 00:33:47.406
and his professional license was revoked.


00:33:48.167 --> 00:33:51.762
I want to know
what your father thought of you...


00:33:52.447 --> 00:33:54.802
joining the Hitler Youth?


00:33:54.927 --> 00:33:57.600
My dad never influenced
our political preferences.


00:33:58.887 --> 00:34:04.678
Typical democrat!
Why did you join the Hitler Youth?


00:34:04.807 --> 00:34:07.162
Because I had heard that
Hitler will bring our nation glory,


00:34:07.287 --> 00:34:11.485
good luck and fortune, and that
everyone will have a job and bread.


00:34:11.607 --> 00:34:14.326
That everybody will enjoy
freedom and happiness.


00:34:20.847 --> 00:34:24.556
You are single?
- I am engaged.


00:34:25.207 --> 00:34:29.883
With Fritz Hartnagel
He is a commander on the Eastern front.


00:34:30.727 --> 00:34:34.322
Stalingrad?
- Yes.


00:34:34.447 --> 00:34:39.805
When was the last time you saw each other?
- More than half year ago.


00:35:15.087 --> 00:35:16.884
Have you seen this gun before?


00:35:18.767 --> 00:35:22.646
My brother had a gun like this
He was sergeant in the army.


00:35:22.767 --> 00:35:25.645
Why do you have 190 bullets
in your drawer?


00:35:25.727 --> 00:35:29.561
9mm bullets?
- They are also my brother's.


00:35:29.687 --> 00:35:32.759
When was the last time you
bought stamps?


00:35:34.647 --> 00:35:37.445
About two weeks ago.
- Where, and how many?


00:35:38.567 --> 00:35:41.206
A the post office #23
on Leopold street.


00:35:41.927 --> 00:35:45.840
Ten 12 cents. Perhaps five 6 cents.
I can't remember exactly.


00:35:45.967 --> 00:35:48.401
No more than that?
- No.


00:35:58.527 --> 00:36:00.404
Have you seen these stamps?


00:36:04.767 --> 00:36:05.961
No.


00:36:06.647 --> 00:36:09.684
- You've never seen them before?
- No.


00:36:12.327 --> 00:36:15.160
We found those in your brother's room.


00:36:21.887 --> 00:36:24.037
Why did you never mention...


00:36:24.167 --> 00:36:26.442
that your brother has these
quantities of stamps?


00:36:26.567 --> 00:36:29.206
Youwhen and where <i>I</i>
bought stamps recently.


00:36:29.327 --> 00:36:33.639
140? Who of you, and what for
did you need these stamps?


00:36:33.767 --> 00:36:36.565
What were you planning
to mail out?


00:36:36.767 --> 00:36:38.837
Greeting to friends and relatives.
We write a lot.


00:36:38.927 --> 00:36:41.680
So, you have seen those stamps?
- I am guessing.


00:36:41.807 --> 00:36:44.958
You found those at
my brother's place. Not mine!


00:36:59.607 --> 00:37:01.438
Do you own a typewriter?


00:37:01.847 --> 00:37:04.077
The one in my brother's room,
we borrowed from the landlord.


00:37:04.207 --> 00:37:07.040
She lent it to us so my brother
can type something. - What?


00:37:07.167 --> 00:37:10.204
An essay about philosophy
and theology.


00:37:19.127 --> 00:37:22.563
Not this flyer here?
- No.


00:37:23.727 --> 00:37:27.242
An essay about philosophy and
theology like this perhaps...


00:37:28.767 --> 00:37:32.362
"Hitler cannot win this war,
he can only prolong it."


00:37:32.727 --> 00:37:37.039
or "a criminal cannot give Germany victory"


00:37:38.167 --> 00:37:42.479
or "federalism is the future of Germany


00:37:42.607 --> 00:37:45.963
freedom of speech, freedom of religion."


00:37:49.767 --> 00:37:51.837
Hans didn't write those.


00:37:54.967 --> 00:37:57.003
You did?
- No.


00:37:57.607 --> 00:38:01.566
But you believe in this kind of world order.
- I don't care about politics.


00:38:03.607 --> 00:38:06.326
Anyway, we analyzed this typewriter,
and it was used


00:38:06.447 --> 00:38:09.564
to write a pamphlet which was,
at the beginning of this month,


00:38:09.687 --> 00:38:13.680
mailed to different addresses in
Munich and Augsburg.


00:38:14.447 --> 00:38:16.324
I don't know anything about this.


00:38:25.647 --> 00:38:28.400
Sit down!
- Watch her.


00:38:47.007 --> 00:38:50.158
You were there when we found
this pamphlet on your brother,


00:38:50.287 --> 00:38:52.164
and when he tried to destroy it.


00:39:01.647 --> 00:39:03.558
Have you seen this paper before?


00:39:04.887 --> 00:39:08.357
No. - Read it,
before you make any false statements.


00:39:12.367 --> 00:39:15.757
"200,000 Germans died,
sacrified for the status...


00:39:15.847 --> 00:39:19.362
of a military imposter."
- Does this remind you something?


00:39:19.447 --> 00:39:23.281
Isn't it pretty similar to other six flyers?


00:39:24.487 --> 00:39:26.079
And what about the handwriting?


00:39:27.527 --> 00:39:30.121
I dont recognize it.
- Give me a break!


00:39:31.127 --> 00:39:34.199
The guy who wrote this is
an individual named Christoph Probst,


00:39:34.327 --> 00:39:37.876
He is a friend of yours from lnnsbruck.
We found his letters at your place.


00:39:38.007 --> 00:39:39.884
The exact same handwriting!


00:39:41.647 --> 00:39:45.640
Probst is also studying medicine.


00:39:48.167 --> 00:39:53.116
Loves the family and the
mountains of his fatherland.


00:39:53.247 --> 00:39:58.401
Another privileged brat, dragging his own country into the mud,
while others are dying in the war.


00:40:03.007 --> 00:40:05.202
Who else is involved in this, beside you,
your brother and that Christoph Probst?


00:40:05.287 --> 00:40:07.755
Please stop accusing me!


00:40:07.887 --> 00:40:11.436
You withheld all this
evidence from your home,


00:40:11.567 --> 00:40:15.276
even though I asked you
to tell me the truth.


00:40:15.407 --> 00:40:17.318
I just only admit what I really know.


00:40:24.407 --> 00:40:28.320
Do you want to know what your brother
said about this evidence,


00:40:28.927 --> 00:40:31.202
after he tried to deny it first,
just like you.


00:40:34.447 --> 00:40:37.086
"With the military failure in the East,


00:40:37.207 --> 00:40:40.563
And with the enormous increase
in American and British forces,


00:40:40.687 --> 00:40:44.396
I concluded that we could not win this war,


00:40:44.527 --> 00:40:48.884
and that the only way
to avoid further bloodshed,


00:40:49.007 --> 00:40:52.602
and to keep a European community,


00:40:52.727 --> 00:40:57.323
lies in finding a way
to shorten this war.


00:40:57.447 --> 00:41:02.521
I am also deeply concerned about
the treatment people in the occupied zones


00:41:02.647 --> 00:41:06.879
This is just a political statement,
not a response to you accusations


00:41:08.887 --> 00:41:12.596
This is just a political statemen.
It doesn't have anything to do with your accusations.


00:41:12.727 --> 00:41:13.796
This...


00:41:14.927 --> 00:41:17.725
is undermining the moral of the army
and treason.


00:41:19.647 --> 00:41:21.956
I dont believe my brother said that!


00:41:22.087 --> 00:41:26.239
So you think I am fabricating evidence?


00:41:26.367 --> 00:41:28.927
Unless my brother tells me personally
that he made those statements


00:41:29.007 --> 00:41:30.725
I won't believe that he said that.


00:41:31.367 --> 00:41:34.598
You're familiar with the
Eickemayer Studio, aren't you?


00:41:36.007 --> 00:41:37.281
Yes.


00:41:38.287 --> 00:41:42.326
Eickemayer is in Krakau for a few months.
He gave us the key...


00:41:42.447 --> 00:41:45.644
to the studio to us, so we can
show his pictures to his friends.


00:41:46.767 --> 00:41:49.281
The fingerprint on the copymachine...


00:41:49.367 --> 00:41:51.085
are your brother's.


00:41:57.287 --> 00:41:59.164
Your brother has confessed.


00:42:02.247 --> 00:42:05.637
He admitted to have designed,


00:42:08.367 --> 00:42:14.078
copied and handed out
all six kinds of the flyers.


00:42:16.247 --> 00:42:19.762
He claims that he handed out
five thousand flyers in Munich in one night.


00:42:30.807 --> 00:42:32.957
You lived with your brother,


00:42:33.047 --> 00:42:36.835
you were with him on the balcony
this morning,


00:42:36.967 --> 00:42:40.243
and you still want me believe
that you have nothing to do with this?


00:42:40.687 --> 00:42:43.804
You claim you didn't know what these
flyers were about? Just admit it!


00:42:43.927 --> 00:42:48.284
You and your brother made
and sent those pamphlets!


00:42:56.567 --> 00:42:59.240
Yes!
And I am proud of it!


00:43:06.847 --> 00:43:09.156
What will happen to me and
my brother now?


00:43:09.287 --> 00:43:12.199
You should have thought about this
earlier, Miss Scholl.


00:43:14.447 --> 00:43:17.757
Will out family be arrested?
- Others will decide that.


00:43:23.127 --> 00:43:26.642
I have to go to bathroom.
- Not now.


00:43:27.127 --> 00:43:29.197
Who drafted these?


00:43:30.247 --> 00:43:33.478
Me! - You are lying again, Miss Scholl!
Just a few weeks ago...


00:43:33.607 --> 00:43:35.996
we did a scientific analysis
of the writing,


00:43:36.127 --> 00:43:40.006
and we are absolute sure
they are done by a male.


00:43:40.127 --> 00:43:42.595
An intellectual. Your brother!


00:43:46.047 --> 00:43:50.086
Who mailed out these flyers?
My brother and I.


00:43:58.007 --> 00:44:00.396
Excuse me, I really have to go to bathroom.


00:44:08.567 --> 00:44:09.841
Lohner!


00:44:13.247 --> 00:44:14.362
Bathroom!


00:44:16.047 --> 00:44:17.321
Follow me.


00:45:25.127 --> 00:45:27.243
Hurry!


00:45:45.447 --> 00:45:48.280
Open the handcuffs, it hurts!


00:45:49.727 --> 00:45:52.116
What are you doing with them?


00:45:52.807 --> 00:45:56.516
You know the colleagues, Miss Scholl?
There's gonna be one after the other now...


00:45:56.647 --> 00:45:59.559
Next door to the left.
You know the way.


00:46:13.527 --> 00:46:17.725
Who did this graffity:
"Down with Hitler!"...


00:46:18.647 --> 00:46:20.365
and "Freedom"...


00:46:21.607 --> 00:46:26.965
and a crossed-out swastika,
at Ludwig street University,


00:46:27.087 --> 00:46:30.363
at Marienplatz, Kaufinger street
and in Schwabing?


00:46:30.487 --> 00:46:32.523
My brother and I
made them.


00:46:38.767 --> 00:46:42.919
Your brother said after he got arrested:
"Go back home...


00:46:43.047 --> 00:46:45.515
tell Alex not to wait for me".


00:46:47.527 --> 00:46:49.597
Schertling was right there.


00:46:49.727 --> 00:46:53.083
Was he telling Schmorell to run away?


00:46:53.367 --> 00:46:56.837
Hans had a appointment with Schmorell,
he didnt want him wait for nothing.


00:46:56.967 --> 00:47:00.562
- You talk about your plan with Schmorell?
- No


00:47:02.007 --> 00:47:04.726
What about Graf?
- Neither.


00:47:17.127 --> 00:47:21.120
Why do you keep lying, Miss Scholl?
- I am not lying.


00:48:01.887 --> 00:48:03.081
Here.


00:48:05.047 --> 00:48:07.561
This is your confession.
Sign here.


00:48:48.247 --> 00:48:49.441
Lohner!


00:48:55.567 --> 00:48:56.761
Take her away!


00:49:16.767 --> 00:49:19.042
Mohr supposedly told Lohner:
this kind of people...


00:49:19.127 --> 00:49:23.359
is what Germany needs.
But we have to re-educate them.


00:49:24.647 --> 00:49:27.480
Maybe they will try to
rebuild your world view.


00:49:31.687 --> 00:49:35.077
But I'm telling you,
they're in for a surprise.


00:49:35.447 --> 00:49:39.360
Why?
- Even the bosses are getting scared.


00:49:39.487 --> 00:49:42.081
A lot people think the invasion will
happen within eight to ten weeks.


00:49:42.207 --> 00:49:45.358
And then it'll be quick -
Germany will be liberated.


00:49:52.767 --> 00:49:56.476
If my mother finds out
I am under arrest,


00:49:57.807 --> 00:50:00.162
she won't survive the shock.


00:50:00.927 --> 00:50:05.478
She is over 60,
and has been sick for months.


00:50:08.887 --> 00:50:12.038
If the Gestapo comes to my house...


00:50:12.967 --> 00:50:15.481
she my get jailed as well...


00:50:18.007 --> 00:50:18.962
And your father?


00:50:19.087 --> 00:50:23.842
He is 10 years younger.
He always gave us strength.


00:50:25.447 --> 00:50:27.244
Then at least she's not alone.


00:51:13.447 --> 00:51:14.766
Thanks.


00:51:17.887 --> 00:51:20.526
"We will not be silent,
we are your forgotten conscience!


00:51:20.647 --> 00:51:23.115
The "White Rose" won't let you
sleep in peace!".


00:51:24.247 --> 00:51:27.284
Who is "us"?
- My brother wrote this.


00:51:27.407 --> 00:51:30.763
The last line of 4th flyers ends with:
"Please copy...


00:51:30.887 --> 00:51:34.800
and pass around".
Here, at last, is talk about resistance.


00:51:35.967 --> 00:51:39.516
That doesn't sound like an individual's crime.
- There is no organization.


00:51:39.847 --> 00:51:41.439
What do you know about Willi Graf?


00:51:41.567 --> 00:51:45.685
Sergeant, he studied medicine like my brother.
He comes to our house occasionally.


00:51:45.967 --> 00:51:49.926
We know he helped you guys
copying the flyers at the studio.


00:51:50.207 --> 00:51:52.004
Maybe you found his fingerprints,


00:51:52.127 --> 00:51:55.039
but he went to studio at some other time.
- When?


00:51:55.167 --> 00:51:58.318
Middle of January.
We were showing Eickemayer's paintings.


00:51:58.447 --> 00:52:00.677
That's why there are all kinds of
fingerprints in studio.


00:52:00.807 --> 00:52:04.846
Who else was there? Schmorell?
- Maybe, I dont know.


00:52:04.967 --> 00:52:08.039
I was just there at beginning,
then I went to concert.


00:52:09.367 --> 00:52:13.246
Did Probst bring flyer to Salzburg
and Linz? - No.


00:52:13.367 --> 00:52:17.519
Hans didn't tell him anything,
cause he has wife and three children


00:52:18.287 --> 00:52:22.280
You better tell me the damn truth.
I am expecting from you...


00:52:22.407 --> 00:52:25.399
to finally own up to
what's going on.


00:52:35.687 --> 00:52:37.484
Graf, Anneliese?


00:52:38.207 --> 00:52:41.244
I met her about 8-10 times.


00:52:41.367 --> 00:52:45.326
What did you talk about?
- About literature and science.


00:52:45.687 --> 00:52:49.123
I found Graf rather unpolitical.
- Unpolitical, but an insider?


00:52:49.647 --> 00:52:53.526
I have to insist that Graf has absolutely
nothing to do with the flyers.


00:52:53.647 --> 00:52:56.605
How about Schertling?
- Gisela I met several times,


00:52:56.727 --> 00:53:00.515
since we studied at same university.
I know her from labor camp Krauchwies.


00:53:00.647 --> 00:53:05.243
She is a national-socialist.
- By your saying, Miss Scholl,


00:53:05.367 --> 00:53:09.246
Germans are either apolitical
or are admirers of the movement.


00:53:10.767 --> 00:53:13.122
Then everything should be fine for you,
isn't it, Mr Mohr?


00:53:36.967 --> 00:53:39.561
As per our investigations
this so called "White Rose"...


00:53:39.687 --> 00:53:42.645
bought 10,000 sheets of paper
in January alone...


00:53:42.727 --> 00:53:45.366
as well as 2,000 envelopes.


00:53:45.487 --> 00:53:48.365
Who did that?
- My brother and I.


00:53:48.447 --> 00:53:50.244
It may sound plausible,


00:53:50.767 --> 00:53:53.964
since the first four issues
only had impressions in the Hundreds.


00:53:54.087 --> 00:53:56.681
You don't expect me to believe
that you and your brother alone...


00:53:56.807 --> 00:53:59.685
copied thousands of flyers
for the 5 and 6th edition?


00:53:59.807 --> 00:54:04.198
and then sent them out?
- We worked on them day and night.


00:54:04.607 --> 00:54:09.397
Very admirable. And beside that you are
still taking classes?


00:54:10.327 --> 00:54:15.162
Yes. We were trying to make it look
like there were lots of members.


00:54:20.407 --> 00:54:23.638
We know that your brother, Graf von Schmorell,
as well as some...


00:54:24.247 --> 00:54:26.807
Furtwängler, and a Wittenstein served
together at the Eastern front.


00:54:26.927 --> 00:54:29.441
They all study here in Munich.


00:54:30.287 --> 00:54:33.643
And there was no political
communication between them?


00:54:34.687 --> 00:54:37.247
My brother only told me about the
mass deaths, but not about...


00:54:37.367 --> 00:54:40.882
his comrades.
- I don't believe you, Miss Scholl.


00:54:41.007 --> 00:54:45.159
Nowadays everyone is careful
when it comes to political opinions.


00:54:45.927 --> 00:54:48.077
Just like you with your flyers.


00:54:50.887 --> 00:54:52.798
Where did you get these addresses?


00:54:52.927 --> 00:54:55.680
Copied from phonebooks
at the German museum.


00:55:00.847 --> 00:55:06.444
Let's take a look at Stuttgart:
On Jan 27th and the morning after,


00:55:06.567 --> 00:55:09.604
about 700 flyers were mailed.


00:55:09.727 --> 00:55:12.480
At the same day in Munich...


00:55:12.607 --> 00:55:15.724
about 2,000 flyers were distributed.


00:55:15.847 --> 00:55:19.556
It's impossible for you and your brother
to have done this... 2,000 pieces!


00:55:19.767 --> 00:55:23.521
I took the express train
to Stuttgart on the 27th...


00:55:23.847 --> 00:55:27.203
I had the flyers in my suitcase.
After I arrived...


00:55:27.287 --> 00:55:30.597
I threw half of them
into the mailbox at the station,


00:55:30.687 --> 00:55:33.042
and the rest I put
into mailboxes in the outskirts.


00:55:33.167 --> 00:55:37.365
Your brother couldn't have distributed
2,000 flyers in Munich by himself.


00:55:37.487 --> 00:55:40.160
2,000 flyers, put into phone books,
in public phone booths.


00:55:40.287 --> 00:55:44.405
In Munich as well as other cities.
Who helped him?


00:55:44.887 --> 00:55:47.082
I wasn't in Munich.


00:55:48.767 --> 00:55:51.440
Who supported you financially?


00:55:51.567 --> 00:55:54.365
My father gives me 150 Reichsmark
every month,


00:55:54.567 --> 00:55:56.762
and my brother
is paid by the army.


00:55:56.887 --> 00:56:01.165
You're saying you can afford your life as well as
all the flyers and postage with that?


00:56:03.687 --> 00:56:07.566
Each of your many trips to Ulm
already costs 15 Mark.


00:56:07.647 --> 00:56:11.037
We borrowed some money from friends.
- From whom?


00:56:19.847 --> 00:56:22.805
Here, upper left corner...


00:56:23.487 --> 00:56:26.081
The letter "I" probably stands
for income.


00:56:26.207 --> 00:56:30.644
And the name after amount must be the donor.
- Yes.


00:56:30.727 --> 00:56:32.843
Your fiancé is in that list as well.


00:56:39.967 --> 00:56:42.037
So he was a member of the group!
- No!


00:56:42.847 --> 00:56:45.441
Everytime we borrowed money,
we made up a story.


00:56:45.567 --> 00:56:47.762
You can ask anyone on the list.


00:56:50.367 --> 00:56:53.120
My brother and I are
who you are looking for.


00:56:58.527 --> 00:57:01.803
Have you ever thought about
the consequences for you and your brother...


00:57:01.927 --> 00:57:03.724
getting into this kind of thing?


00:57:10.807 --> 00:57:12.877
We have all the names!


00:57:17.327 --> 00:57:20.717
Miss Scholl, you should consider
cooperating with us.


00:57:21.407 --> 00:57:23.921
This would have a positive effect
on your sentence.


00:57:24.367 --> 00:57:27.996
Think about your poor parents,
and the shame you brought to them.


00:57:28.127 --> 00:57:31.881
Mr Mohr, you accuse us of treason.
And now you want us...


00:57:32.007 --> 00:57:35.522
to betray our so-called comrades,
just to save my own skin?


00:57:36.367 --> 00:57:39.677
Helping solve a crime
is not a betrayal.


00:57:39.967 --> 00:57:42.686
My brother's classmates
have nothing to do with this.


00:57:49.287 --> 00:57:50.481
Lohner!


00:57:54.727 --> 00:57:55.921
Take her away!


00:58:08.167 --> 00:58:10.078
I am very worried about Fritz.


00:58:11.287 --> 00:58:13.881
How could I write his name in my notebook?


00:58:15.647 --> 00:58:18.764
Was he part of it?
- Absolutely not.


00:58:18.887 --> 00:58:22.436
And he really didn't have a clue?
- No.


00:58:23.847 --> 00:58:26.964
His is a solider, and he
keeps up his oath to Hitler.


00:58:28.287 --> 00:58:32.075
We had lots of fights about this.
I was always against supporting the front line,


00:58:32.207 --> 00:58:35.802
as it would only prolong the war.
He didn't agree with that at all.


00:58:37.327 --> 00:58:41.366
Was he in Stalingrad too?
- He was there.


00:58:42.567 --> 00:58:46.003
Luckily, he was transfered to Lemberg
as one of the last groups.


00:58:46.767 --> 00:58:51.966
He is now in a hospital.
They amputated two of his fingers,


00:58:53.167 --> 00:58:55.840
since he and his people
were out in the cold...


00:58:55.967 --> 00:58:58.606
at 30 below. Day and night.
For weeks.


00:58:58.727 --> 00:59:02.879
I really hope he'll survive the war,
without becoming its victim.


00:59:04.167 --> 00:59:06.965
What if he finds out
what happened to you?


00:59:07.647 --> 00:59:09.763
he will understand me.


00:59:20.967 --> 00:59:22.366
I hope so.


00:59:23.767 --> 00:59:25.837
What does he look like?


00:59:27.647 --> 00:59:30.081
Tall, dark hair.


00:59:31.887 --> 00:59:33.605
A free spirit.


00:59:34.567 --> 00:59:37.161
He could always
make me laugh.


00:59:38.647 --> 00:59:43.437
The love, this unconditional love,
is just so amazing.


00:59:44.887 --> 00:59:47.162
When was the last time you saw him?


00:59:50.007 --> 00:59:55.400
Last summer.
We were in Karolinensiel at the North Sea.


00:59:55.847 --> 00:59:59.556
We sailed out with a fishing boat
early in the morning...


01:00:01.167 --> 01:00:03.840
and in the evening
to the flats on a horse carriage.


01:00:05.247 --> 01:00:09.320
At night we sang,
and talked about peace.


01:00:10.447 --> 01:00:15.237
No soliders, no planes and no bombs.


01:00:17.367 --> 01:00:20.404
Only the sea, the sky,


01:00:22.847 --> 01:00:24.917
sea breeze and our dreams.


01:01:22.127 --> 01:01:25.802
Dear God, I can't help
but babble to you.


01:01:26.407 --> 01:01:29.717
I can do nothing else
but to offer you my heart.


01:01:30.527 --> 01:01:34.486
You created us,
and our hearts are so tense,


01:01:34.607 --> 01:01:36.723
until it finds peace in You.


01:01:38.127 --> 01:01:39.480
Amen.


01:01:58.847 --> 01:02:00.644
Here, have some.


01:02:16.047 --> 01:02:18.003
It's real coffee... From beans.


01:02:19.287 --> 01:02:23.280
Miss Scholl, you are concerned about the
welfare of the German people, aren't you?


01:02:24.647 --> 01:02:27.957
Yes. - Unlike this Elser,
who planted a bomb...


01:02:28.047 --> 01:02:30.515
in the Bürgerbräukeller
in Munich 1939.


01:02:30.647 --> 01:02:35.767
Although you chose the wrong slogans,
you used a peaceful methods.


01:02:38.847 --> 01:02:41.156
So why do you guys want
to punish us then anyway?


01:02:41.247 --> 01:02:45.160
Because of the law!
Without law there's no order.


01:02:45.287 --> 01:02:49.075
The law you're referring to
used to defend people's liberty of speech...


01:02:49.207 --> 01:02:52.483
before Hitler took power in 1933.
But now, people who speak up


01:02:52.607 --> 01:02:57.556
are punished by prison or death.
What does order have to do with this?


01:02:58.047 --> 01:03:00.641
What else should we abide by,
if not by the law,


01:03:00.767 --> 01:03:03.998
no matter by whom it was drafted.
- By your conscience.


01:03:05.367 --> 01:03:06.766
Oh really...


01:03:09.047 --> 01:03:11.800
This is the law,
and this is the people.


01:03:11.967 --> 01:03:15.039
And my job as a police officer
is to see whether the two align.


01:03:15.167 --> 01:03:16.839
And if it doesn't...


01:03:18.087 --> 01:03:21.204
I have to figure out where the problem is.
- Laws change.


01:03:21.327 --> 01:03:24.319
The conscience doesn't.
- What if everyone would decide for themselves...


01:03:24.447 --> 01:03:27.598
what's right and wrong, by his conscience.
Even if a criminal...


01:03:27.727 --> 01:03:30.639
would succeed in overthrowing
the leader, what would happen then?


01:03:30.767 --> 01:03:34.123
We would end up in criminal chaos!
The so-called free expression,


01:03:34.247 --> 01:03:37.159
federalism, democracy?
We used to have them all.


01:03:37.247 --> 01:03:39.078
And we know where
that got us.


01:03:39.207 --> 01:03:42.836
Without Hitler and his party there would finally
be law and order for everyone.


01:03:43.167 --> 01:03:46.842
And protection for every individual,
not just those agreeing with the general consensus.


01:03:47.567 --> 01:03:49.285
Arbitrariness. Follower.


01:03:49.407 --> 01:03:52.319
What gives you the right to be this dismissive?
- You are the one being dismissive.


01:03:52.447 --> 01:03:55.598
If you label my brother and me criminals,
just because of those flyers,


01:03:55.847 --> 01:03:58.998
even though we've done nothing but
trying to convince with words.


01:03:59.287 --> 01:04:03.803
You and your privileges, that you
and your clique are exploiting shamelessly.


01:04:03.927 --> 01:04:06.487
You are using our money
to go to college during wartime.


01:04:06.607 --> 01:04:09.679
During that damn democracy,
all I could become was a tailor.


01:04:09.807 --> 01:04:12.605
Do you know who made me join the police?
The French who occupied Pfalz.


01:04:12.727 --> 01:04:16.163
Not German democracy.
If there hadn't been the movement


01:04:16.287 --> 01:04:18.721
I would still be a police officer
in the countryside of Pirmasens today.


01:04:20.767 --> 01:04:25.158
The shameful Versailles Treaty,
inflation, unemployment.


01:04:25.247 --> 01:04:28.922
The economic crisis. All that was swept away
by our leader Adolf Hitler.


01:04:29.047 --> 01:04:31.242
And also lead Germany into a doomed war.


01:04:31.367 --> 01:04:34.643
For whom every further victim is a waste.
- Into the heroic war!


01:04:34.967 --> 01:04:37.606
You receive the same food stamps
as we,


01:04:37.727 --> 01:04:39.445
the ones you disdain
and fight against.


01:04:39.567 --> 01:04:42.161
No matter what happens
you live a better life than we do.


01:04:42.767 --> 01:04:47.443
You absolutely have no need to do so.
Why is it that you're still acting up?


01:04:47.567 --> 01:04:49.922
The leader and the German people
are protecting you!


01:04:50.047 --> 01:04:53.722
In here, in this Wittelsbacher Palais,
or having my family arrested.


01:04:53.847 --> 01:04:56.725
Our German soldiers are liberating Europe
from the money class...


01:04:56.847 --> 01:05:00.556
and from the Bolschewists, and are fighting
for a great and free Germany.


01:05:00.687 --> 01:05:03.759
Germany's territory will never again
be occupied. Mark my words.


01:05:03.887 --> 01:05:06.481
Until this war is over, and
foreign troops will march in...


01:05:06.607 --> 01:05:10.316
and all kinds of people will point at us,
saying we didn't fight against Hitler.


01:05:10.807 --> 01:05:13.446
And what will you say when,
after the final victory has been achieved...


01:05:13.527 --> 01:05:16.325
and after all that blood and sacrifice
wealth and freedom will reign in Germany?


01:05:16.447 --> 01:05:20.235
The things you dreamed about
when you joined the Hitler Youth?


01:05:21.967 --> 01:05:25.118
German people don't anymore expect
that to happen in Hitler's Germany.


01:05:26.047 --> 01:05:28.686
But what if it really did come true,
then what?


01:05:31.647 --> 01:05:34.207
Are you a protestant?
- Yes.


01:05:35.207 --> 01:05:37.641
Even the Church is asking
the disciples to follow them.


01:05:37.767 --> 01:05:40.884
Even if they doubt.
- Church is voluntary.


01:05:41.527 --> 01:05:44.724
But Hitler and the Nazis
will not give you any choices!


01:05:46.047 --> 01:05:50.598
Why would a young person like you
risk everything for mislead ideas?


01:05:56.967 --> 01:05:59.083
For my own conscience.


01:06:01.967 --> 01:06:03.719
I don't understand
why you, with your talent,


01:06:03.847 --> 01:06:06.645
wouldn't agree with
National Socialist ideas.


01:06:07.367 --> 01:06:09.597
Freedom, Honor, Wealth.


01:06:09.727 --> 01:06:13.276
A morally responsible country,
<i>this</i> is our faith!


01:06:13.527 --> 01:06:16.564
Didn't the horrible bloodshed the
National Socialists caused...


01:06:16.647 --> 01:06:19.241
all over Europe,
in the name of freedom and honor,


01:06:19.367 --> 01:06:21.039
open up your eyes?


01:06:23.887 --> 01:06:26.355
Germany's name will forever be shamed
if the German youth...


01:06:26.487 --> 01:06:30.162
won't overthrow Hitler, in order to
create a new spiritual Germany!


01:06:30.527 --> 01:06:33.724
The new Europe can only be
of national socialist nature.


01:06:33.847 --> 01:06:36.202
And what if your leader
is a lunatic?


01:06:36.767 --> 01:06:39.998
Think about national hatred!
We had a Jewish teacher in Ulm...


01:06:40.127 --> 01:06:44.200
who was forced to stand
in front of an SA-Group,


01:06:45.167 --> 01:06:48.637
and everyone was ordered to walk
in front of him and spit in his face.


01:06:50.047 --> 01:06:54.837
Since that night, he's gone. Just like
thousands of others here in Munich since '41.


01:06:54.927 --> 01:06:57.202
Presumably sent to
work camps in the East.


01:06:57.487 --> 01:07:01.560
You believe this nonsense?
The Jews are emigrating themselves.


01:07:01.687 --> 01:07:04.804
Solders who were at the Eastern front have been
talking about extermination camps for a while.


01:07:04.927 --> 01:07:07.646
Hitler wants to eradicate
all Jews in Europe.


01:07:07.767 --> 01:07:11.157
He has been promoting this madness
for 20 years already.


01:07:11.287 --> 01:07:13.960
How can you believe
that Jews are different from us?


01:07:14.047 --> 01:07:17.039
This gang has only brought us misery.
But you belong...


01:07:17.167 --> 01:07:20.637
to a confused generation that doesn't
understand anything. Wrong upbringing.


01:07:20.767 --> 01:07:25.045
But it's probably it's our own fault.
I would have raised a girl like you differently.


01:07:25.327 --> 01:07:27.283
If you knew how shocked it was
when I heard that


01:07:27.407 --> 01:07:32.640
Nazis are killing mentally handicapped
children with poison gas!


01:07:33.127 --> 01:07:37.086
My mother's friends told me
how children from Church program were taken...


01:07:37.207 --> 01:07:40.597
from the institute,
and transported away in trucks.


01:07:41.767 --> 01:07:45.043
The other kids were asking
"Where does the truck go?"


01:07:45.767 --> 01:07:49.282
"They're going to heaven"
the nurses told them.


01:07:49.687 --> 01:07:53.077
So the rest of the kids got
on the truck as well. Singing.


01:07:53.287 --> 01:07:56.836
And because I feel for these people
you think my upbringing must've been wrong?


01:07:59.487 --> 01:08:04.800
These are unworthy lives.
You have been trained as a nurse...


01:08:05.007 --> 01:08:07.999
you must have met
mental patients.


01:08:08.647 --> 01:08:12.322
Yes, and that's why I clearly know
that there are no circumstances,


01:08:12.447 --> 01:08:15.996
under which a person should
make judgements that only God could make.


01:08:16.407 --> 01:08:19.797
Nobody knows what in going on
in the soul of a mental patient.


01:08:20.287 --> 01:08:23.438
Nobody knows which secret,
interior maturity could rise out of suffering.


01:08:23.567 --> 01:08:25.637
Every life has a value.


01:08:28.527 --> 01:08:32.281
You have to get used to
this coming of a new age.


01:08:33.527 --> 01:08:36.803
What you are talking about
has nothing to do with reality.


01:08:37.407 --> 01:08:42.527
Of course it is related to reality.
With reality, decency,


01:08:42.727 --> 01:08:46.436
morality and God.
- God doesn't exist...


01:09:08.567 --> 01:09:14.437
Isn't it right that you
relied on your brother,


01:09:14.567 --> 01:09:19.846
that you agreed with him,
and just went along?


01:09:20.327 --> 01:09:22.841
Shouldn't we just
take it down like that?


01:09:24.247 --> 01:09:26.283
No, Mr. Mohr.
Because it is not the truth.


01:09:37.167 --> 01:09:40.921
You known, I have a son.
He is even a year younger than you are.


01:09:41.647 --> 01:09:45.765
He sometimes has some crazy ideas too,
but now he is at the Eastern front.


01:09:45.887 --> 01:09:48.799
Because he knows
he must do his duty.


01:09:49.047 --> 01:09:51.880
You really believe in the
final victory, Mr. Mohr?


01:09:53.647 --> 01:09:56.480
Ms. Scholl, if you had thought
about all this,


01:09:57.007 --> 01:10:00.238
you would have never
gotten involved in these activities.


01:10:00.807 --> 01:10:02.684
This is about your life!


01:10:12.927 --> 01:10:18.285
Here... For the protocol,
I am accusing you of the following:


01:10:19.847 --> 01:10:22.919
"After our conversation
you have come to the conclusion


01:10:23.047 --> 01:10:26.756
that you and your brother's actions,


01:10:26.847 --> 01:10:30.157
In the current wartime situation,
are a crime against the community.


01:10:30.247 --> 01:10:33.319
Especially in the consideration of
our suffering army in the East,


01:10:33.407 --> 01:10:38.117
and that it should
be condemned to the fullest.


01:10:39.447 --> 01:10:41.722
No, not as I see it.


01:10:42.127 --> 01:10:45.915
Confessing to mistake
is not the same as betraying your brother.


01:10:46.207 --> 01:10:50.086
But a betrayal of the idea.
I would do it all over again,


01:10:50.167 --> 01:10:52.761
because not mine,
but your world view is flawed.


01:10:52.847 --> 01:10:56.760
I still think that
I've done what is right for my people.


01:10:57.167 --> 01:11:01.046
I have no regrets,
and I will take full responsibility.


01:11:12.127 --> 01:11:15.324
Please send up a transcriber.
Yes.


01:11:16.567 --> 01:11:19.001
Tell the boss we are done.


01:11:49.087 --> 01:11:52.921
Mohr offered me a golden bridge
if I renounce our ideas.


01:11:53.487 --> 01:11:56.923
And?
- I didn't go for it.


01:11:57.727 --> 01:11:59.319
Why not?


01:12:00.567 --> 01:12:05.118
Sophie, you are so young, you have to survive.
For your ideas and for yourself.


01:12:05.247 --> 01:12:09.399
And for your family.
For god's sake, take his offer.


01:12:09.767 --> 01:12:11.439
There is no going back.


01:12:30.167 --> 01:12:31.919
Air Raid Alert


01:12:53.687 --> 01:12:57.760
Get down! Away from the windows!
Down here it's the safest.


01:13:06.647 --> 01:13:08.080
Come down!


01:13:11.087 --> 01:13:13.681
It won't take long,
and we're free!


01:13:42.967 --> 01:13:45.162
The new arrival isn't Schmorell,


01:13:46.967 --> 01:13:49.242
it's a Christoph Probst.


01:13:49.687 --> 01:13:51.757
For treason as well.


01:13:58.087 --> 01:14:00.760
I am really sorry.
I thought...


01:14:04.567 --> 01:14:06.444
He has 3 kids.


01:14:11.247 --> 01:14:13.886
The youngest was just born.


01:14:15.367 --> 01:14:18.200
And his wife is down
with childbed fever.


01:14:33.247 --> 01:14:35.556
Ms. Scholl,
you have to see the prosecutor now.


01:14:51.847 --> 01:14:53.280
Go along.


01:15:04.607 --> 01:15:06.598
Here is my indictment.


01:15:08.767 --> 01:15:11.520
Your trial will start tomorrow morning
in front of a senior judge.


01:15:11.607 --> 01:15:14.565
I have submitted a court order.


01:15:14.847 --> 01:15:17.759
Tomorrow already?
- This case doesn't allow any delays.


01:15:27.247 --> 01:15:31.035
<i>Treason, moral disruption</i>
<i>and support of the enemy</i>


01:15:35.727 --> 01:15:38.036
And tomorrow already
will be the trial!


01:15:47.567 --> 01:15:50.035
What a glorious,
sunny day.


01:15:59.767 --> 01:16:02.440
I sincerely pray to you,


01:16:03.847 --> 01:16:06.884
I call upon you,
"You" I call,


01:16:07.007 --> 01:16:12.877
I may not know a thing about you,
but you are still my only hope.


01:16:14.767 --> 01:16:16.166
I pray to you,


01:16:17.047 --> 01:16:22.326
please don't abandon me,
my dear God, my dear father.


01:16:25.567 --> 01:16:27.000
Amen.


01:16:33.567 --> 01:16:36.001
I am attorney Klein,
your court-appointed lawyer.


01:16:36.327 --> 01:16:38.397
Have you seen the indictment?


01:16:40.687 --> 01:16:42.803
Yes.
- Any questions?


01:16:44.087 --> 01:16:46.806
What will happen to my parents
and siblings in Ulm?


01:16:51.167 --> 01:16:52.441
Please!


01:16:54.447 --> 01:16:56.756
This will be decided
in a separate case.


01:16:57.247 --> 01:17:01.525
I just want to know what will happen.
Aren't you my lawyer?


01:17:01.967 --> 01:17:05.243
You act like I got you
into this situation.


01:17:05.367 --> 01:17:08.484
I am entitled to know what will happen
to my family, and you know that!


01:17:08.567 --> 01:17:11.320
Do you really think you are in a position
to make demands?


01:17:13.087 --> 01:17:16.921
No matter what happens to my brother,
I don't want an easier sentence.


01:17:17.047 --> 01:17:19.561
I am just as guilty as he is,
by your viewpoint.


01:17:19.687 --> 01:17:22.076
Is that all you got to say?


01:17:23.047 --> 01:17:26.005
No. - It seems, you and your brother
don't feel like...


01:17:26.127 --> 01:17:30.120
actually becoming part of the community.
But you are very wrong about that!


01:17:30.247 --> 01:17:33.842
Even the chairman of the people's court
will be here tomorrow.


01:17:33.967 --> 01:17:36.356
He will make sure
you will forget about this nonsense.


01:17:36.487 --> 01:17:39.081
He won't have any mercy with you.


01:17:39.767 --> 01:17:41.837
Open the door!


01:17:43.967 --> 01:17:48.597
Do you want something?
- No, nothing. We'll see you in court tomorrow.


01:17:53.407 --> 01:17:54.886
What a coward.


01:18:00.447 --> 01:18:03.519
Freisler will be presenting both of you
as rotten criminals tomorrow.


01:18:04.207 --> 01:18:08.166
He used to be a USSR officer.
Now he has to prove his loyalty.


01:18:09.367 --> 01:18:12.916
Our father used to say:
I want you to live straight and free,


01:18:13.127 --> 01:18:14.924
even if it may be hard.


01:18:26.407 --> 01:18:28.477
Will the trial be public?


01:18:29.407 --> 01:18:33.446
I'm sure it is.
It's a show trial, a deterrent.


01:18:33.567 --> 01:18:36.001
Then Freisler will have to talk about
the flyers in front of everybody!


01:18:36.127 --> 01:18:41.042
And everyone will hear what we have to say.
I'm sure there's going to be a riot...


01:18:41.167 --> 01:18:44.637
among the students when they find out
what's happening because of some flyers.


01:18:48.047 --> 01:18:53.440
After the trial you will probably be transferred.
And in the worst case:


01:18:53.567 --> 01:18:57.116
everyone gets 99 days
before excecution.


01:19:01.007 --> 01:19:05.523
"A tough mind, and a soft heart"
my brother used to say.


01:19:14.967 --> 01:19:16.639
I once dreamed...


01:19:17.007 --> 01:19:19.999
that I was holding a child in my arms,
with a long white dress.


01:19:20.127 --> 01:19:23.915
I could feel her warmth...
But suddenly the earth shook,


01:19:24.047 --> 01:19:26.845
and beneath me
a crevasse opened.


01:19:27.847 --> 01:19:31.601
I began to slip.
And I look at the child...


01:19:31.727 --> 01:19:35.163
but I still had enough time
to put her safely on the ground...


01:19:36.247 --> 01:19:40.240
I plunged, but I still felt liberated
and relaxed.


01:19:41.887 --> 01:19:45.721
The child in the long white dress
is our idea, and it survived.


01:19:50.927 --> 01:19:54.966
Scholl, get ready for transport!
- She has to get dressed properly first!


01:20:02.767 --> 01:20:03.995
Thanks.


01:20:28.927 --> 01:20:32.124
May God be with you, Sophie!
- May God be with you, Else!


01:20:33.767 --> 01:20:35.041
Thank you so much.


01:22:47.047 --> 01:22:49.561
How are you?
- And yourself?


01:22:49.647 --> 01:22:52.207
Be quiet!
Only speak when are you are asked!


01:22:53.327 --> 01:22:55.716
You must fight for yourself now.
- Quiet now!


01:23:11.967 --> 01:23:14.481
Heil Hitler.
- Heil Hitler!


01:23:32.127 --> 01:23:35.164
I hereby announce
the court of the people opened...


01:23:35.287 --> 01:23:39.963
agaist Hans Fritz Scholl and
Sophie Magdalena Scholl from Munich.


01:23:40.087 --> 01:23:44.478
and further Christoph Hermann Probst
from Aldrans, for acts of treason,


01:23:44.607 --> 01:23:47.644
moral disruption
and support of the enemy.


01:23:47.967 --> 01:23:50.242
Probst, Christoph!


01:24:10.247 --> 01:24:13.444
You are married with 3 children?


01:24:13.847 --> 01:24:17.203
Yes, 2 and a half, 1 and 3 months,
and 4 weeks old.


01:24:17.327 --> 01:24:21.718
And how is a failure like you
supposed to raise...


01:24:21.847 --> 01:24:25.635
three children, to be real Germans?
- I am a good father and...


01:24:25.807 --> 01:24:28.401
"and" what?


01:24:30.367 --> 01:24:32.039
...and have no political ambition.


01:24:32.167 --> 01:24:35.637
No political ambitions...
You are making me laugh!


01:24:37.447 --> 01:24:39.278
Is this your handwriting?


01:24:40.687 --> 01:24:44.316
Yes. - Despite the welfare
of the German national socialist Reich...


01:24:44.447 --> 01:24:46.563
to provide you with an education,
and despite the fact...


01:24:46.687 --> 01:24:51.602
that the national socialist
population politics allowed you...


01:24:51.727 --> 01:24:54.719
to have your family as a student,
that still didn't keep you...


01:24:54.847 --> 01:24:58.840
from creating this manuscript
when Scholl's asked you to.


01:24:58.967 --> 01:25:01.879
An article which uses the heroic
experiences of Stalingrad...


01:25:02.007 --> 01:25:05.283
to portrait our leaders
as a military imposter,


01:25:05.407 --> 01:25:08.365
and to promote surrender.
Do you admit this?


01:25:08.487 --> 01:25:10.842
Yes, sir.
But it was just a draft...


01:25:10.967 --> 01:25:15.358
There is no "just", when the German people
are fighting to survive.


01:25:15.487 --> 01:25:19.400
But I have to admit that I was rather
depressed at the time when I wrote this...


01:25:19.487 --> 01:25:23.116
Really?
So a clinical depression was causing you...


01:25:23.207 --> 01:25:25.721
to write this essay?


01:25:25.847 --> 01:25:29.283
...depressed at the time when I wrote this.


01:25:29.407 --> 01:25:32.001
The war, my wife's fever,
all of those...


01:25:32.087 --> 01:25:36.319
Oh, please stop! This is no excuse
to commit treason of this scale!


01:25:36.447 --> 01:25:38.881
But I already distanced myself
from this yesterday. In writing.


01:25:39.487 --> 01:25:42.479
I also have to clarify that
I did not finance...


01:25:42.607 --> 01:25:45.565
or materially support,
produce, or distribute...


01:25:45.647 --> 01:25:48.161
any of these pamphlets.


01:25:48.247 --> 01:25:51.045
My emotional condition was...
- Yes, we have all heard how you...


01:25:51.167 --> 01:25:55.126
...are trying to play the psychotic retard,
in order to get out of this.


01:25:59.087 --> 01:26:02.397
Mr. Chairman,
my children need their father.


01:26:02.527 --> 01:26:05.917
German children do not
need a father like you.


01:26:06.047 --> 01:26:10.040
You are unworthy, Probst!


01:26:14.647 --> 01:26:18.003
Defence, any further questions?
- No, Mr. Chairman.


01:26:19.207 --> 01:26:20.322
Take him away!


01:26:37.327 --> 01:26:39.841
Scholl, Hans...


01:26:56.287 --> 01:27:01.315
You have studied medicine
since 1939? - Yes.


01:27:01.447 --> 01:27:05.076
And you are, thanks to this
national socialist government,


01:27:05.207 --> 01:27:08.563
in your 8th term by now.
- Yes, the 8th term is correct.


01:27:08.687 --> 01:27:13.556
On this nation's money!
Another parasite.


01:27:14.247 --> 01:27:17.284
At some point you were serving
at a field hospital...


01:27:17.407 --> 01:27:21.923
and worked as medical staff on the
Eastern front, between July and November 1942?


01:27:22.047 --> 01:27:23.924
That is true too.
But I want to say that...


01:27:24.047 --> 01:27:28.040
Be quiet until lI ask you!
- I wanted to say that I am not a parasite...


01:27:28.167 --> 01:27:30.920
Shut your mouth
or I will have you removed!


01:27:31.047 --> 01:27:34.357
...study is a duty,
for a member for the student guard.


01:27:34.487 --> 01:27:37.797
Oh well,
let's talk about duty then...


01:27:37.927 --> 01:27:42.443
As a student you have the duty
to be an exemplary member of the community.


01:27:42.567 --> 01:27:46.116
This, and the support the Reich
provided you with,


01:27:46.247 --> 01:27:50.923
didn't stop you,
during the summer of 1942,


01:27:51.247 --> 01:27:55.035
from handing out four "White Rose"
flyers which, in a derogatory way,


01:27:55.167 --> 01:27:59.240
tried to predict the German defeat,
and was calling for a passive resistance,


01:27:59.367 --> 01:28:03.280
and sabotage of military industries.
And was generally...


01:28:03.407 --> 01:28:07.400
trying to promote ways to remove
the national socialist way of life...


01:28:07.527 --> 01:28:10.644
from the German people.
- This is outrageous!


01:28:10.767 --> 01:28:12.758
The boldness...
- Traitors... - ...the fatherland...


01:28:12.847 --> 01:28:14.963
Scholl, do you admit this?


01:28:15.447 --> 01:28:20.316
Yes. - And you even cowardly got
your sister involved into this.


01:28:23.407 --> 01:28:26.797
It was my own decision.
- Did I ask you, defendant?


01:28:26.927 --> 01:28:30.920
I need to correct this.
- Save us your commentaries!


01:28:33.367 --> 01:28:36.518
Did you write these flyers
since you imagined...


01:28:36.647 --> 01:28:41.516
that the German people would only
be able to survive by betraying their leader?


01:28:46.607 --> 01:28:50.486
The war cannot... - Yes or no?
This is not a difficult question!


01:28:50.607 --> 01:28:53.963
We do not have a chance against
the US, the UK and the Russia.


01:28:54.087 --> 01:28:55.805
Just look at the map for yourself!


01:28:55.927 --> 01:28:59.078
With mathematical accuracy is Hitler
leading Germany into an abyss.


01:28:59.207 --> 01:29:01.641
He cannot win this war,
all he can do is extend it!


01:29:01.767 --> 01:29:05.555
You are quite wrong about the
fighting spirit...


01:29:05.687 --> 01:29:08.645
and the stamina
of the German people!


01:29:08.767 --> 01:29:11.327
Through your terrorist support
of the enemy...


01:29:11.447 --> 01:29:14.245
even more German will die!


01:29:14.367 --> 01:29:17.598
Only if we find a way to quickly
to the war, can we avoid...


01:29:17.727 --> 01:29:19.797
Stop the war? How that?
- ...avoid that even...


01:29:19.927 --> 01:29:23.840
So, you think it's up to you
to decide about war and peace?


01:29:23.967 --> 01:29:28.245
The German people
want the total war!


01:29:28.367 --> 01:29:32.758
Germans' blood had bled dry, they want
peace. Hitler and his supporters...


01:29:32.847 --> 01:29:35.645
will be responsible for a
unbelievable genocide in Europe,


01:29:35.767 --> 01:29:39.362
one which will exceed any known scale.
Everybody here knows that...


01:29:39.447 --> 01:29:41.756
Everyone...
- Who do you think you are?


01:29:41.887 --> 01:29:44.879
You despicable dog,
you have the audaciousness...


01:29:44.967 --> 01:29:48.084
to insult the leader
in front of this court?


01:29:48.767 --> 01:29:52.760
I myself was at the Eastern front,
just like many in the audience here.


01:29:54.047 --> 01:29:55.526
You weren't there!


01:29:55.927 --> 01:29:59.920
With my own eyes I have seen
the bloodshed in Poland and Russia.


01:30:00.127 --> 01:30:02.800
I saw women and children dying...


01:30:04.047 --> 01:30:07.562
killed by German soldiers.
- And you really think that...


01:30:07.647 --> 01:30:13.119
anybody here will believe your nonsense?


01:30:13.247 --> 01:30:15.522
If Hitler and you
weren't afraid of our thoughts,


01:30:15.647 --> 01:30:18.366
then we wouldn't be standing here today.
- Oh, shut up!


01:30:18.487 --> 01:30:22.480
It is anyway...
shameless liar...


01:30:22.607 --> 01:30:27.681
You are nothing but an... an idiot
and a rotten traitor.


01:30:28.167 --> 01:30:29.885
End of questioning.


01:30:31.847 --> 01:30:34.486
Any more questions?
- No.


01:30:36.127 --> 01:30:39.961
No further question, Mr. Chairman.
- Scholl, Hans, back to your seat.


01:30:54.167 --> 01:30:55.805
Sophia Scholl...


01:31:09.047 --> 01:31:12.084
Aren't you ashamed to have
handed out those treasonous flyers...


01:31:12.207 --> 01:31:16.280
at the university?
- No, I am not ashamed at all!


01:31:16.407 --> 01:31:19.001
Throwing them into the atrium...
just like that?


01:31:19.887 --> 01:31:22.845
No, not just like that,
but to get even the last ones...


01:31:22.967 --> 01:31:25.527
Speak up,
we can hardly hear you.


01:31:26.727 --> 01:31:28.877
I wanted to distribute every last one
of the flyers, so that our ideas...


01:31:29.007 --> 01:31:34.479
would spread as quickly as possible...
- Idea? You call this filth a idea?


01:31:34.607 --> 01:31:38.316
You would expect this from a certified idiot,
but not a German University student.


01:31:39.007 --> 01:31:42.636
We fight with words.
- So you actually wrote:


01:31:44.127 --> 01:31:49.645
"That's why you should separate from
those sub-human national socialists!"


01:31:49.767 --> 01:31:53.680
Have a look at yourself,
if you want to see some sub-human beings!


01:31:54.047 --> 01:31:57.244
How did you get the paper
to make these pamphlets?


01:31:57.367 --> 01:32:01.918
We bought them, and from the university.
- So, from the university?


01:32:02.047 --> 01:32:07.246
Malicious theft of common property! Paper!
Even though there is a shortage of paper!


01:32:07.367 --> 01:32:10.325
But I am not surprised
that you would do this.


01:32:10.447 --> 01:32:12.836
My brother and I tried to use
these flyers to awaken the people,


01:32:12.967 --> 01:32:17.324
and to stop the bloodshed
against other countries and the Jews.


01:32:17.447 --> 01:32:21.076
And not to wait for the Allies
to finally put an end to it.


01:32:21.487 --> 01:32:24.399
Should we really become a nation,
excluded and hated by the rest of the world?


01:32:24.527 --> 01:32:26.802
You know, a superior people
doesn't care about this


01:32:26.927 --> 01:32:30.158
Your superior people actually
want peace.


01:32:31.407 --> 01:32:34.046
And to find pride in humanity
once again.


01:32:34.967 --> 01:32:39.165
It wants God, conscience,
and compassion.


01:32:39.247 --> 01:32:41.807
Well, who do you think
you are?


01:32:41.887 --> 01:32:45.084
The total war will bring victory
to Germany.


01:32:45.207 --> 01:32:51.123
It will come out of this
stronger and more pure.


01:32:51.367 --> 01:32:54.120
What we said and wrote
is shared by many.


01:32:54.967 --> 01:32:58.846
They just don't dare to say it.
- Oh, shut up already!


01:32:59.447 --> 01:33:02.120
Questions?
- No.


01:33:05.767 --> 01:33:08.406
Session finished.
Take her away!


01:33:19.487 --> 01:33:23.400
We will now come to the closing
statements of the defendant.


01:33:24.327 --> 01:33:30.038
I am the father...
- Remove these people from the court!


01:33:30.127 --> 01:33:32.766
I am Robert Scholl, the father of
two of the defendants.


01:33:32.967 --> 01:33:36.164
I want to clarify a few points...
- I have no permission! Remove him!


01:33:36.247 --> 01:33:40.638
Get out, take him out!
- There is another type of justice!


01:33:43.887 --> 01:33:44.956
Silence!


01:33:48.407 --> 01:33:52.844
Now for your closing statements.
Defendants, rise!


01:33:55.607 --> 01:33:59.441
Probst? - I beg you to spare me,
for the sake of my children.


01:33:59.967 --> 01:34:02.435
I admit and repent
everything I have done.


01:34:05.207 --> 01:34:06.879
And you, Scholl?


01:34:11.727 --> 01:34:15.402
I beg you, your honor. Spare this man,
and punish me instead.


01:34:15.487 --> 01:34:20.163
If you have nothing to say on your own
behalf, then be silent!


01:34:23.167 --> 01:34:25.044
Sophia Scholl?


01:34:26.287 --> 01:34:29.165
Soon you will stand where
we are standing right now.


01:34:30.127 --> 01:34:34.325
Every decent being in this room is
outraged about what you are saying!


01:34:49.927 --> 01:34:52.122
In the name of the German people,


01:34:52.767 --> 01:34:56.646
the following charges against
Hans Fritz Scholl from Munich,


01:34:56.767 --> 01:34:59.964
Sophia Magdalena Scholl
from Munich...


01:35:00.167 --> 01:35:02.840
and Christoph Hermann Probst
from Aldrans...


01:35:02.967 --> 01:35:06.801
are recognized by the 1. Senate of the
supreme court...


01:35:06.887 --> 01:35:10.960
on February 22nd, 1943:


01:35:11.047 --> 01:35:15.916
The defendants have been sending out flyers
during the war, in order to sabotage...


01:35:16.007 --> 01:35:20.762
the arms production, and to overthrow the
national socialist way of life of our people,


01:35:20.847 --> 01:35:25.363
to promote dangerous ideas and
to disgrace our leader...


01:35:25.447 --> 01:35:28.166
and by doing so, helped the enemies
of this country...


01:35:28.247 --> 01:35:30.636
and demoralized our troops.


01:35:30.727 --> 01:35:33.525
You are therefore
sentenced to death.


01:35:33.607 --> 01:35:36.246
You are deprived of any rights
as a citizen of this country.


01:35:36.327 --> 01:35:39.000
You will cover the expenses
for this trial.


01:35:39.087 --> 01:35:40.998
Your terror will soon be over.


01:35:42.247 --> 01:35:45.523
Today you will hang us, and tommorrow
it will be your turn.


01:35:45.607 --> 01:35:47.086
Take them away!


01:35:52.047 --> 01:35:54.163
Heil Hitler!
- Heil Hitler!


01:37:42.847 --> 01:37:44.041
This way!


01:38:03.927 --> 01:38:06.077
If you have anything to say
before your execution...


01:38:06.167 --> 01:38:08.886
Please make it short,
Ms. Scholl.


01:38:10.887 --> 01:38:12.684
Today already?


01:38:14.247 --> 01:38:16.841
I was told
everybody has 99 days...


01:38:17.207 --> 01:38:18.925
You better start writing.


01:40:30.967 --> 01:40:33.356
Come here.
You have a visitor.


01:40:34.887 --> 01:40:36.161
A visitor?


01:41:13.967 --> 01:41:16.083
Please don't be afraid.


01:41:17.447 --> 01:41:19.802
Given the choice, i would
do the same thing again.


01:41:20.207 --> 01:41:24.837
You did well.
I am proud of you.


01:41:34.247 --> 01:41:35.839
My little girl.


01:41:38.327 --> 01:41:39.646
Mama...


01:41:42.367 --> 01:41:45.279
How you stand by me,
brave and steadfast.


01:41:48.407 --> 01:41:51.717
Now you will never again
come in through our door.


01:41:52.847 --> 01:41:55.315
We will meet again
in eternity.


01:41:57.047 --> 01:42:00.642
Well, Sophie.
Jesus...


01:42:00.927 --> 01:42:04.636
Yes, Mother, but you too...


01:42:05.647 --> 01:42:08.036
Ms. Scholl, please.


01:42:52.447 --> 01:42:55.166
I just said farewell to my parents.


01:42:56.767 --> 01:42:58.325
They will understand.


01:43:01.207 --> 01:43:02.640
Come with me, please.


01:43:24.527 --> 01:43:27.963
Ms. Scholl, my name is Alt.


01:43:28.247 --> 01:43:30.636
I am the prison priest.


01:43:31.247 --> 01:43:33.841
God, oh almighty father,


01:43:34.967 --> 01:43:38.039
make this earth fruitful,


01:43:38.127 --> 01:43:40.641
so the seeds you sow
do not fall in vain,


01:43:41.727 --> 01:43:45.242
Let hope grow,
oh my creator,


01:43:45.607 --> 01:43:48.519
for those who will only see it
for the last time.


01:43:50.007 --> 01:43:52.601
Amen.
- Amen.


01:43:57.127 --> 01:43:59.402
I beg you to give me
God's blessing.


01:44:07.767 --> 01:44:13.239
God the father gives you his blessing,
for you are created by his own image.


01:44:13.727 --> 01:44:16.116
God, the son gives you his blessing,


01:44:16.327 --> 01:44:19.717
for his suffering and death have saved you.


01:44:20.447 --> 01:44:23.086
God, the holy spirit gives you his blessing,


01:44:23.447 --> 01:44:27.565
for he has taken you to his sacred temple.


01:44:29.367 --> 01:44:33.280
Oh, all mighty God,
have mercy in your judgement...


01:44:34.367 --> 01:44:37.120
and grant you
the eternal life.


01:44:38.327 --> 01:44:39.760
Amen.
- Amen.


01:44:51.847 --> 01:44:55.362
No one's love is greater than those
who sacrifice themselves for others.


01:44:56.007 --> 01:44:57.645
God is with you.


01:45:12.967 --> 01:45:15.481
This is against the regulations, but...


01:45:37.607 --> 01:45:39.598
Please hurry.


01:45:42.367 --> 01:45:43.925
Thanks.


01:46:27.487 --> 01:46:29.045
It was not in vain.


01:47:07.767 --> 01:47:09.325
Ms. Scholl.


01:47:29.967 --> 01:47:31.525
The sun is still shining.


01:47:57.287 --> 01:47:59.198
Sophia Magdalena Scholl,


01:47:59.447 --> 01:48:04.919
The national attorney general has decided,
on 22.2.1943,


01:48:05.287 --> 01:48:07.517
that no pardon will be granted.


01:48:07.607 --> 01:48:10.360
So as not to obstruct justice.


01:48:12.127 --> 01:48:16.518
It is exactly 5:00 pm.
The death sentence is to be carried out.


01:48:50.447 --> 01:48:52.677
Long live Freedom!


01:49:37.047 --> 01:49:40.084
<i>Helmuth von Moltke brought the</i>
<i>6th flyer from the "White Rose"</i>


01:49:40.167 --> 01:49:43.796
<i>through Scandinavia to England.</i>
<i>Millions of copies were...</i>


01:49:43.887 --> 01:49:48.358
<i>air-dropped by the Allied planes<i>
<i>over Germany in 1943.<i>


01:49:48.647 --> 01:49:52.003
<i>Its title was:</i>
<i>A german flyer,</i>


01:49:52.087 --> 01:49:54.555
<i>Manifest of Munich students.<i>

